name = "Geno"
description = "RESUME

Geno Krasimir, 32. CEC Inc. 2nd Street, East Breach, Lanmar.

Education: 
	Palace University, Dept. of Analysis (ages 18-22)
	Clover Boarding School for the Gifted and Talented (ages 5-18)
	General Knowledge Index of '08 - 80th percentile.
Work Experience:
	Computer, Cresti Expansion Company (ages 21-31)
		Was responsible for calibrating artefact sensors
		Analyzed sensor results, communicating results with coworkers and clients.
		Oversae organization and shipping of artefacts to mainland.
	Junior Coordinator, Palace Park (ages 16-19)
		Tidied locations and equipment.
		Second degree repairman access. Repair shadowship.
		Guided students through landmarks and historical of importance of Palace Park.
Skills:
	Instrumental Analysis, Computing, Computer Reporting, General Knowledge, Exceptional Hygiene
Background:
	Degrees from royal blood: 5

I haven't had a chance to update this since I moved to East Breach. Hopefully this is acceptable. I come from a reputable family and have relevant experience. 

Details:
 - Good at math.
 - Exists in the first person.
 - Really needs this."
